DESCRIPTION:Individual singers from across the region and country\, plus m
 embers of the Hartford Chorale gather in Worcester for the third-annual ch
 oir performance to conclude the 2026 BACHtoberfest Weekend. The BACHtoberf
 est Choir assembles for this concert annually\, rehearsing a series of J.S
 . Bach’s cantatas together over the course of the weekend prior to the c
 ulminating concert on Sunday afternoon. This ensemble aims to unite voices
  from everywhere in song\, with a shared passion for the music of J.S. Bac
 h. Learn more about joining this year’s BACHtoberfest Choir. Program Wie
  schön leuchtet der Morgenstern \, BWV 1 Gott der Herr ist Sonn und Schil
 d \, BWV 79 Nun danket alle Gott \, BWV 192 Gleichwie der Regen und Schnee
  vom Himmel fällt \, BWV 18* *Performed by the Hartford Chorale. All othe
 r cantatas performed by the BACHtoberfest Choir and the Hartford Chorale S
 ources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercen
 tralma.org/event/bachtoberfest-choir-2026/30213/\n\nEvents Near Me: within
  30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massa
 chusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/
 bachtoberfest-choir-2026/30213/
LOCATION:Mechanics Hall\, 321 Main St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/bachtoberfest-choir-2026/30213
