BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Geneva Lewis
DTSTART:20261025T000000
DTEND:20261025T000000
DTSTAMP:20261025T151745Z
UID:4560823891dd03c993f87fbb323835@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Geneva Lewis—a rapidly rising star on the international stag
 e—makes her Vivo Performing Arts debut with a program of striking emotio
 nal range and intention. Praised for her lustrous tone and the rare abilit
 y to unite fervent passion with immaculate precision\, Lewis moves from Mo
 zart's surprising\, nocturnal G-Major Sonata into the tender longing of Si
 lvestrov's miniatures\, the somber weight of Weinberg's survival-haunted s
 onata\, and the electric intensity of Webern. With Strauss' early violin s
 onata—glowing\, love-struck\, and radiantly alive—Lewis brings this di
 stinguished debut to a spirited and joyful close. Rapidly rising star Gene
 va Lewis makes her Vivo Performing Arts debut with a program of striking e
 motional range. Lewis is praised for her lustrous tone and rare ability to
  unite fervent passion with immaculate precision. Single tickets will go o
 n sale August 13\, 2026 at noon. LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS Sources: Meet Bo
 ston Event page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/geneva-lewis/91744/\n\nE
 vents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Loca
 l fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.meetbos
 ton.com/event/geneva-lewis/91744/
LOCATION:Meadow Hall at Groton Hill Music Center\, Meadow Hall at Groton H
 ill Music Center 122 Old Ayer Rd\, Groton\, MA\, 01450
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/geneva-lewis/91744/
END:VEVENT
