UID:c8bb23f5629ffa5cb1a510fad1f38a@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:This six-week\, project-based class is designed for students w
 ho have had an introduction to the basics of watercolor and are looking to
  continue their practice. All projects will be centered around illustratin
 g food and drink recipes in a variety layouts. The class covers how to pai
 nt various ingredients and how to arrange them into strong compositions. E
 ach project will include guidance for color matching\, a step by step walk
 through for the portrait and highlight specific painting and linework tech
 niques for this subject. All projects are designed to be traced in Micron 
 Pen before painting to add contrast and technical detail to the portrait. 
 No drawing experience required. Prerequisite: Introduction to Watercolor D
 ates: Weekly from October 26 - December 7 Meets: Mondays from 6:00 PM to 9
 :00 PM Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.dis
 covercentralma.org/event/watercolor-%26-pen-%3a-recipe-illustration/30564/
