BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ghosts! Strange Tales from 13 Years of Paranormal Investigating
DTSTART:20261027T000000
DTEND:20261027T000000
DTSTAMP:20261025T151745Z
UID:ff227915ca8c3aac14cfc961bea55e@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Ghosts! Strange Tales from 13 Years of Paranormal Investigatin
 g Explore unexplained evidence and lessons learned from a seasoned paranor
 mal investigator. Dr. Joanna MacGugan shares stories from her paranormal a
 dventures and demonstrates how you\, too\, can investigate haunted locatio
 ns. About Joanna MacGugan: Joanna MacGugan\, PhD\, is a social historian a
 nd paranormal investigator. She has been fascinated with the paranormal si
 nce she experienced disembodied voices and footsteps in Edinburgh’s unde
 rground vaults in 2014. Her goal is to always seek the historical truth be
 hind hauntings. Joanna grew up in Chelmsford\, Massachusetts\; Stuttgart\,
  Germany\; and Huntingdonshire\, England. Her European adventures fueled h
 er passion for macabre history\, especially cemeteries and burial culture.
  Her master’s research centered on early Celtic Otherworld mythology. Fo
 r her PhD research\, she turned to coroners and capital punishment in 14th
 -century Ireland. In 2023\, she published her first book\, Social Memory\,
  Reputation and the Politics of Death in the Medieval Irish Lordship. Joan
 na is now a full-time copy editor and independent scholar. Her current res
 earch projects focus on the haunted Oliver House in Middleborough\, Massac
 husetts\, and supernatural stories from records of the Salem Witch Trials.
  Learn about our Library of Things at mywpl.org. Place a hold on the LOT G
 host Hunting Kit here! Want to stay in the know about all things WPL? Sign
  up for our eNewsletter! Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event pag
 e: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/ghosts!-strange-tales-from-13-y
 ears-of-paranormal-investigating/30909/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles
  of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-
 events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/ghosts!-s
 trange-tales-from-13-years-of-paranormal-investigating/30909/
LOCATION:Worcester Public Library\, 3 Salem St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/ghosts!-strange-tales-from-13-
 years-of-paranormal-investigating/30909/
END:VEVENT
