DTSTART:20261028T000000
DTEND:20261028T000000
DTSTAMP:20261025T151745Z
UID:8202e13dd201466583752c90ca1884@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Seattle Children’s Theatre The alphabet bursts 
 to life in this playful\, music-filled adventure. With costumes\, puppets 
 and lively songs\, the letters scramble up a towering coconut tree—until
  it becomes too crowded and comes crashing down in one big “BOOM!” Ami
 d the chaos\, Little z struggles to find their place\, always arriving las
 t and left behind. With the help of the Big Letters and a heartwarming fin
 ale\, z learns that everyone has value and a place to belong. Full of audi
 ence participation\, rhythm and surprises\, this joyful adaptation of the 
 beloved children’s book is a celebration of music\, literacy and the pow
 er of community. Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https
 ://www.discovercentralma.org/event/chicka-chicka-boom-boom%3a-the-musical/
 30807/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDisc
 overy: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://
