BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Artist Talk: Sneha Shrestha
DTSTART:20261029T000000
DTEND:20261029T000000
DTSTAMP:20261025T151745Z
UID:11d49ad44a51ccf4ccce2aa7b64a54@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exciting discussion featuring Nepali artist Sne
 ha Shrestha\, known artistically as IMAGINE\, in conversation with curator
  Sarah Laursen. Shrestha’s work infuses her native Devanagari script wit
 h the visual language of graffiti handstyles to convey stories about migra
 tion\, diasporic identity\, and belonging. Working across painting\, mural
 s\, and sculpture\, she uses calligraphic repetition to create meditative 
 spaces of color and gesture that foster reflection\, protection\, and prid
 e. LEARN MORE Sources: Meet Boston Event page: https://www.meetboston.com/
 event/artist-talk%3a-sneha-shrestha/93780/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 mi
 les of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachuset
 ts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/artist-talk%3
 a-sneha-shrestha/93780/
LOCATION:Harvard Art Museums\, Harvard Art Museums 32 Quincy Street\, Camb
 ridge\, MA\, 02138
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/artist-talk%3a-sneha-shrestha/93780/
END:VEVENT
