 rious specimens rarely seen by the public. Face unusual insects\, reptiles
 \, invertebrates\, strange plants\, and treacherous minerals. Don a Hallow
 een costume and snap photos at our photo booth. We encourage costumes insp
 ired by nature! Decorate a trick-or-treat bag. Visit Collecting Wonders: T
 omorrow’s Discoveries\, showcasing rare objects from the collections\, f
 rom a massive polar bear to tiny jewel-like beetles. Enjoy a variety of be
 verages for purchase (valid government ID required to consume alcoholic be
 verages). Enter a free raffle to win museum gifts and membership. Free and
  open to the public. Let us know you are coming! RSVPs are encouraged\, bu
 t walk-in visitors are always welcome. Free event parking is available at 
 the 52 Oxford Street Garage with registration from 4:30-9:30 pm. Register 
 by October 28 to receive parking registration instructions. ArtsThursdays 
 is a university-wide initiative supported by Harvard University Committee 
 on the Arts. LEARN MORE Sources: Meet Boston Event page: https://www.meetb
 oston.com/event/halloween-at-the-museum/93484/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 3
