BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Alexander's Jazz Time Band
DTSTART:20261030T000000
DTEND:20261030T000000
DTSTAMP:20261025T151745Z
UID:7df8fc6279ce3f8534c43260133d11@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Alexander's Jazz Time Band\, an 11-piece 1920's-style syncopat
 ed orchestra\, will present a concert of authentic Jazz Age dance-band arr
 angements on Friday\, October 30th at The First Parish of Bolton (673 Main
  Street\, Bolton MA). The show starts at 7:00 PM and ends around 8:30. The
  program will feature\, among other things\, three early compositions by j
 azz maverick Fud Livingston\, two newly resurrected arrangements from the 
 library of the Roger Wolfe Kahn Orchestra\, and an arrangement of "Someday
  Sweetheart" written in 1931 by a young Glenn Miller. Most of the pieces o
 n the program are suitable for foxtrot dancing\; floor space will be avail
 able for that purpose throughout the show. The performance will be held in
  Davis Hall. Parking is behind the church\; entry is via the footbridge in
  back. Additional parking may be found on the west side of the main church
  building. Davis Hall is wheelchair accessible. No tickets or reservations
  are necessary. Admission is free\, but donations are gratefully accepted.
  Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discoverc
 entralma.org/event/alexanders-jazz-time-band/31168/\n\nEvents Near Me: wit
 hin 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from ma
 ssachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/eve
 nt/alexanders-jazz-time-band/31168/
LOCATION:The First Parish of Bolton\, The First Parish of Bolton 673 Main 
 Street\, Bolton\, MA\, 01740
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/alexanders-jazz-time-band/3116
 8/
END:VEVENT
