UID:88a53ef2f882a11571e9a470ddec62@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Come explore the art of glass fusing and slumping! In this cou
 rse\, you’ll learn how to create both jewelry and slumped glass pieces. 
 Students can design pendants\, earrings\, coasters\, plates\, and more. Yo
 ur instructor will demonstrate essential techniques\, including cutting an
 d grinding glass\, adding findings\, slumping glass into molds to create f
 unctional ware\, and other creative methods. You’ll learn a lot while ha
 ving fun\, bringing your glass designs to life. No prior experience is req
 uired and beginners of welcome! The materials fee includes basic glass sup
 plies. Students can buy more glass from the studio as needed (cash or chec
 k) or bring their own glass to work. Please wear natural fiber fabrics and
  closed-toe shoes. Dates: Weekly from October 30 - November 13 (3 Weeks) M
 eets: Fridays from 6:00 PM to 9:00 PM Sources: Discover Central Massachuse
 tts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/fusing-%26-slumpin
