DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20261025T151745Z
UID:b10c2f9a8c02b2a89bce084e14ff86@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Haunt the bars in Worcester with us at our Halloween Bar Crawl
  on Oct. 31st - don’t ghost us! 🎃 Get Spooky With US This Halloween! 
 🎃 Round up your boo crew\, show off your costumes\, and prepare for a n
 ight of creepy cocktails\, chills\, and unforgettable bar-hopping fun! 
 👻🍹 Click ✅ GOING ✅ On The Facebook Event ⬇️ So You Don't Mis
 s Updates https://www.facebook.com/events/866464309214699 Here's What You 
 Get: 👽 Join a Spine-Chilling Crowd of Spooky Crawlers! 🍹 2-3 Drinks 
 or Shots Included With Ticket Purchase 🚫 No Cover At All Bars\, Mid Par
 ty\, & After Party 📸 Professional Photographers 🥤 Crawl With US Stad
 ium Party Cup and Bottle Opener Lanyard 🍻 Exclusive Drink Specials 🍔
  Food Specials at Select Venues 🔥 Awesome After Party 📛 Custom Hallo
 ween Bar Crawl Badge With Vouchers 🗺️ Access To Our Worcester Pub Cra
 wl Map 🚨 Get tickets NOW before prices go up! 🚨 ____________________
 ___________________ This October 31st\, join us in Worcester's for a wicke
 dly fun bar crawl featuring creepy cocktails\, outrageous costumes\, and a
 n electrifying atmosphere. We’re making our way through Worcester's top 
 bars with exclusive drink deals\, Halloween-themed entertainment\, and sur
 prises lurking around every corner. Grab your friends and throw on your mo
 st hilarious\, horrifying\, or out-of-this-world outfits—because this ni
 ght is all about bold looks and big scares. Each stop on the crawl will br
 ing a new vibe\, from bone-rattling beats to ghoulishly good drinks. Wheth
 er you're dressed as a vampire\, villain\, or just out to vibe\, this is t
 he place to be for Halloween night. Worcester's is turning up the fright a
 nd fun — and you won’t want to miss a moment. 🎃👻 _______________
 ________________________ 🚨For all the latest venue information\, specia
 l offers\, event details\, and ticket purchases\, be sure to visit our web
 site! It's your one-stop shop for everything you need to know. ⬇️ www.
 crawlwith.us/worcester/halloween 🎃 CHECK IN 4PM - 6PM 🎃 🎃 CRAWL L
 OCATIONS 4PM - 10PM 🎃 🎃 MID PARTY 7PM - 9PM 🎃 🎃 AFTER PARTY 10
 PM - 12AM 🎃 _______________________________________ 100% CANCELLATION R
 EFUND GUARANTEE: 👌If the event is cancelled for any reason\, all ticket
 s will be refunded in full! No vouchers\, no credits\, just your money bac
 k in your bank! Guaranteed! _______________________________________ ✔️
  FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS ✔️ https://www.crawlwith.us/faq __________
 _____________________________ 🚫 DON’T DRINK AND DRIVE 🚫 We Highly 
 Suggest Using Uber or Lyft To And From The Bar Crawl! ____________________
 ___________________ ㉑ ATTENDEES MUST BE 21+ ㉑ Due to the nature of our
  events\, all attendees must be 21+ with a valid government issued ID. Sou
 rces: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentr
 alma.org/event/the-halloween-bar-crawl-worcester/30458/\n\nEvents Near Me:
  within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback fro
 m massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org
 /event/the-halloween-bar-crawl-worcester/30458/
LOCATION:Bay State Brewery & Tap Room\, 112 Harding St\, Worcester\, MA\, 
 01604
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/the-halloween-bar-crawl-worces
 ter/30458/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Whose Live Anyway?
DTSTART:20261031T000000
DTEND:20261031T000000
DTSTAMP:20261025T151745Z
UID:de058ec9a0e0773851d1df30fba001@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night of fast paced\, laugh out loud improv wi
 th Whose Live Anyway? a high energy comedy experience where everything is 
 made up on the spot and the audience is part of the fun. Featuring cast me
 mbers Ryan Stiles\, Greg Proops\, Jeff B. Davis and Joel Murray\, this all
  star lineup brings razor sharp wit\, quick thinking and undeniable chemis
 try to the stage as they create scenes\, characters\, songs and outrageous
  moments right before your eyes. Built entirely on audience suggestions\, 
 no two shows are ever the same. From clever one liners and hilarious games
  made famous on the long running TV show to brand new surprises\, the perf
 ormance is a nonstop ride of spontaneous comedy. With musical direction by
  Laura Hall\, even the songs are improvised and impressively so. Audience 
 participation is key\, so come ready with ideas. You might even find yours
 elf invited onstage. While the show is open to all ages\, please note that
  some PG 13 language may be used. Don’t miss this unforgettable night of
  unscripted comedy where anything can happen and usually does. Sources: Di
 scover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org
 /event/whose-live-anyway%3f/29983/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of N
 orthborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-event
 s.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/whose-live-any
 way%3f/29983/
LOCATION:The Hanover Theatre and Conservatory for the Performing Arts\, 2 
 Southbridge St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/whose-live-anyway%3f/29983/
END:VEVENT
