 s will meet Assumption alumni from a range of career fields and academic b
 ackgrounds and hear how they found success here and beyond. Students are e
 ncouraged to bring their business card or have their LinkedIn QR code read
 y to share\; resumes are not needed. The Denecker Career Development & Int
 ernship Center can help with students’ LinkedIn profiles\, create busine
 ss cards\, and provide networking tips. This event is open to full-time un
 dergraduate students and students in the Accelerated MBA program. Business
  casual attire and advance registration are required . Source: Assumption 
 University Event page: https://www.assumption.edu/news-and-events/events/c
 onnections-and-conversations-with-alumni\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 mile
 s of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from worcester-col
 leges-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.assumption.edu/news-and-events/
